499295279_871500635647274_5005781711240289746_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nB92UfZnWf8Q7kNvwEVdmT_&_nc_oc=AdkF8AGE8RilSJuZc3GcW6MUdzN1rvpU46r5PgowbRMsa15yGWdvqqrt4pdQOf7HK1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft3KM5-8EE4WCq_3Ogm0C14C0iySxvzlIbimY1AEh-P0w&oe=69A18C1D"}, "display_name": "Solitaire - VR Panel", "keywords": ["card", "2D", "relaxed", "solo", "klondike"], "long_description": "Solitaire \u2013 VR Panel is a classic card game built for multitasking on Meta Quest.\n\n# **Play familiar Solitaire in a lightweight VR panel**\nThe game can stay open alongside other apps and experiences. Whether you are taking a break, filling a few spare minutes, or just want something relaxing running in the background.\n\n# **Traditional Solitaire, in VR!**\nThe game includes all the features you would expect from a modern Solitaire experience, including multiple scoring modes, draw 1 or draw 3 options, daily games, hints, undo, and auto-complete for completed wins. Customize your experience with different backgrounds and settings to match how you like to play.\n\n# **Designed specifically as a VR Panel App**\nSolitaire \u2013 VR Panel lets you enjoy a timeless card game without pulling you away from whatever else you are doing in Quest. Play at your own pace, your own way, while keeping other content within reach!", "short_description": "Solitaire - VR Panel brings classic Solitaire to Meta Quest in a lightweight panel you can play alongside anything else. Enjoy familiar options like multiple scoring modes, draw 1 or 3, daily games, customizable backgrounds, and more. Perfect for a quick round while multitasking in VR!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://petricoregames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://petricoregames.com/tos/", "publisher_name": "Petricore", "support_website_url": "https://petricoregames.com/#contact", "website_url": "https://petricoregames.com/", "category"